{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リアルミーグリin幕張\nありがとうございました🎐🍧"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobUGxRrH.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobDL5ZcM.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobs829bA.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobH7wUgn.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "浴衣着ました~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさんの前で着るのは初めて\nちょっとだけ緊張しました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わたしの浴衣姿を見て、夏のはじまり感じた！って言ってくれた方が多くて嬉しかった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日のため、わたしのためにしてきてくれたこと、全部全部受け取ったよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年の夏も隣にいてね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobi8H26P.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お花たくさんありがとう(  . .)\""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しくてパシャパシャが止まりませんでした\nメッセージもひとつひとつ読ませてもらったよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "後ろを見るたびあたたかい気持ちにさせてもらいました💐"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobB7mr9M.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こういう撮り方やってみたかったの"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobKq62Eu.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "実は、ねおとたまたま浴衣が似てたの\n髪飾りは全く同じなんです~ 運命？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobPsLH7w.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "厚底を履いて得意げな顔をしたら\nおこられましたー！(◜ᴗ◝ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📢 お知らせです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15thSingleに収録されている四期生楽曲\n「We got your back」のMVが公開されました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/VD38V6K9lyI?si=LXSF34EkB9_QmQCd"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "9人みんなで、どう表現しようか悩みながら\nひとつひとつ形にした作品です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひご覧ください！\nオフショット整理して載せます☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来週のミーグリも楽しみにしてます\n夏っぽい服着る~ 髪型募集中です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おやすみなさい🌙"}], "source": "official"}